<Border Class="">
	<center>
		<h2><center>RPCS3 (Playstation 3 Emulator) Setup</center></h2>
		<ol>
			<li>Download <a href="https://rpcs3.net/"><b>RPCS3</b></a></li>
			<li>Install a <a href="https://www.playstation.com/en-us/support/system-updates/ps3/"><b>PS3 firmware</b></a></li>
			<li>Install Persona 5 (and the DLC, if you have it).</li>
			<li>Put your RAP file for Persona 5 in <i>RPCS3\dev_hdd0\home\00000001\exdata</i></li>
			<li>Navigate to <i>dev_hdd0\game\NPEB02436\USDIR</i> and move your downloaded mod.cpk file inside (or build a new one with <a href="https://github.com/TekkaGB/AemulusModManager/releases">Aemulus Package Manager</a>)</li>
			<li>Replace the patch.yml file in the RPCS3 root folder with <b><a href="https://shrinefox.com/getstarted?platform=PS3&game=P5&region=USA&target=emulator">this one</a></b>.</li>
            <li>Make sure the patches are enabled in RCPS3 settings (avoid downloading a different patch.yml when prompted)</li>
			<li>Start the game and enjoy!</li>
		</ol>
	</center>
</Border>

